WEBVTT

00:29:25.347 --> 00:29:30.579
who will write what checks
to people in countries

00:29:30.603 --> 00:29:33.182
that will be outside of their domain?

00:29:33.206 --> 00:29:36.135
And there are large numbers
of those people.

00:29:36.159 --> 00:29:39.394
You know, my wife and I
are trying to help people in Connecticut.

00:29:39.418 --> 00:29:43.760
And you know, I can rattle off
all that is, what a job that is,

00:29:43.784 --> 00:29:44.946
and so on.

00:29:44.970 --> 00:29:48.642
And so, when you have
congresses and presidents

00:29:48.666 --> 00:29:51.134
and they start to say, who will we help,

00:29:51.158 --> 00:29:52.610
and how will that be,

00:29:52.634 --> 00:29:54.150
and what will that mean,

00:29:54.174 --> 00:29:57.166
it gets down to real practical questions.

00:29:57.190 --> 00:29:58.356
And the reality is,

00:29:58.380 --> 00:30:00.822
a lot of those people won't be helped.